  <section class="section teal-soft">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="reveal">What it does not do</h2>
      <p class="reveal">The introduction changes who carries the conversation, not what you agree to.</p>
      <ul class="checklist reveal">
        <li><strong>Skip the rights review</strong>Every record set is checked before a buyer sees it, and the scope is set in writing first.</li>
        <li><strong>Share anything on your behalf</strong>Nothing leaves your systems until you have approved the terms.</li>
        <li><strong>Decide for you</strong>You approve every step, and you can stop at any point.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="link-row reveal"><a href="trust.html">How we handle your data</a> <a href="what-affects-a-deal.html">What affects a deal</a></p>
    </div>
